#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Build the exact target-degree G3AP Macaulay relation matrix.

This is an independent finite-linear-algebra hedge for the G3AP upper bound.
It first identifies standard coordinates in Q=B/(K,E,C), then emits selected
derivative-relation multiples in the six-component target piece.  A generated
matrix remains candidate evidence until its structure and rank are certified.
"""

